173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 378 0 R
/E (Test-Time Augmentation \(TTA\): Inference is not performed blindly on a single image. Every test sample is evaluated across 1 clean view and 30 stochastic augmented views \(utilizing rotation, color jitter, and cropping\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 379 0 R
/E (Variance Reduction: The softmax probabilities across all 31 views are mathematically averaged. This effectively smooths out localized corruptions and neutralizes the test-set distribution shift.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 380 0 R
/E (Multi-Seed Ensembling: To eliminate initialization bias and avoid local minima traps, three identical models are trained completely independently using orthogonal seeds \(42, 137, 7\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 381 0 R
/E (Macro F1 Optimization: The ultimate submission probability is the grand average of these networks. With 3 models evaluating 31 views each, every single test image undergoes 93 distributed evaluations, guaranteeing maximum stability for the final Macro F1 Score.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
